587 0 obj
<</CreationDate(D:20101112222644Z)/Subject(This invention is concerned with materials for nonlinear optical devices for the conversion of optical energy at one frequency to optical energy at another frequency.This invention provides devices for and method of generating coherent second harmonic lig\
ht radiation. The devices comprise a laser source \(10\) of coherent light radiation at a fixed fundamental frequency, a crystalline chiral N-aryl carbamyl compound \(12\) that crystallizes in a non-centrosymmetric configuration, means \(14\) for directin\
g the output radiation of the laser onto the crystalline chiral N-aryl carbamyl compound \(12\), and output means \(16, 18, 20, 22\) for utilizing the second harmonic frequency.)/PDFVersion(1.4)/Creator(Jouve S.A., TaggedPDF v1.27)/Keywords("EP271251"; "EP 271251"; "G02F 01/37"; "C07C127/19"; "C07C125/063"; "Second harmonic generation by carbamic acid derivatives")/Producer(Adobe PDF Library 8.0)/ModDate(D:20101208115800+01'00')/Title(Second harmonic generation by carbamic acid derivatives - European Patent Office - EP 271251 A1)>>
endobj
